# Virtual Grid Units (Sanitized)

This write-up describes the shared coordinate system without disclosing diagnostic overlays.

## Overview
- Defines the normalized 1000×1000 virtual grid for layout calculations.
- Explains conversions between virtual units and pixel coordinates.
- Ensures consistent rendering across UI modules and camera configurations.

## Sanitized Notes
- References to debug overlays, calibration scripts, and performance counters have been redacted.
- Internal tooling notes for high-DPI tuning are documented separately in the private toolkit guide.
